cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Births outside the light cone: entropy deficit in a growing quantum register"
abstract: >-
  Causal bounds, one-dimensional optimality and exact single-domain-wall results for the entropy
  deficit of a quantum register that grows by uncorrelated births, with stabilizer and Haar
  simulations, Coq proofs of the combinatorial parts, and a free-field test of the energy cost
  of the birth condition. Produced with an AI system; see the AI-use statement in README.md.
